Feature: IRIS-6982 - Bulk Created Payee Defaults to Pending State

  Scenario: IRIS-6982-TC-001 - Bulk Created Payee Defaults to Pending State
    Given an Iris Support user can run the bulk payee creation command management script
      And valid new payee creation data is available
    When the user runs the bulk payee creation command management script with a valid new payee record
      And payee creation processing completes
      And the created payee record is opened
    Then the Payee State value is "Pending"
      And the Payee State value is not "Approved"
      And the Payee State matches the approval workflow behavior used for payees created through the Iris UI
